{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"原先悬着的期待在这里第一次真正得到回应，于是人明显舒展开来，感到亲近、温柔而满足；同时仍有一点珍惜似的克制，不是毫无保留地沉进去。\",\"thread\":\"前面之所以保留自己，是因为期待虽重要，却没有实际经验可凭。现在靠近已经真的给了人想要的东西，信任因此不再只是愿望，而有了第一份根据；这种刚刚得到证实的满足足以让人放松和投入，却还不足以把先前的保留全部取消，所以安心与谨慎可以同时存在。\",\"used\":\"第1段已经成立的期待，以及因为尚无实际证实而保留自己的状态。\",\"new\":[\"这份期待第一次得到实际的回报，人已经知道靠近它确实能够带来满足。\",\"信任开始有了经验上的根据，因此投入不再只是建立在期待之上。\",\"先前的保留有所松动，但还没有完全消失。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "140ded0d-0800-47fa-8c5a-67c345ee2f1b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215836072023Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.953, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T21:59:37.043225+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "384c24e65b73f763d331888048bebb451c32108bb0d41be71a791ce8ff270351", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "